@startuml
title Figure 54 — H/W reset waveform

clock "CLK" as clk with period 1

robust "RST_n" as rst

@0
rst is low

@2
rst is high
note bottom of rst : *1

@3
rst is low

@7
rst is high

@0 <-> @3 : tRSTW

@3 <-> @12 : tRSCA

@7 <-> @12 : tRSTH

note bottom of rst
  Device starts a reset sequence
  at the RST_n rising edge
end note

note right
  Host can issue boot
  initiation or CMD1
  ----
  Do not care
end note

@enduml